    "en": {
      "trackName": "Apps for Mobile- Phone Cleaner",
      "description": "Get ready for the all-new Pocket Tools — a multifunctional utility suite built around iOS features.\nIt includes an all-in-one phone cleaner, a full network manager, a hardware monitor, a rich photo toolkit, widgets with 100+ clock styles and a hardware Dashboard, a complete privacy & security vault, and more — with Apple Watch support.\n\nStay informed about your iPhone and iPad anytime, fix everyday frustrations, keep your device in top condition, and enjoy using it even more.\n\nIt also comes with casual games that work fully offline, including Minesweeper, Snake, Sudoku, and more waiting for you to discover.\nApple Watch includes three offline games as well: Minesweeper, Snake, and Ping Pong :-)\n\n* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *\nFeatures:\n\n- All-in-one Phone Cleaner: one-tap smart clean, duplicate photo & video cleanup, duplicate contact cleanup, calendar junk cleanup\n- Network Manager: traffic monitoring, network device scanner (spot unknown devices on your Wi-Fi), speed test, IP addresses (cellular, router, LAN, and public WAN), Safari ad blocking\n- Hardware Monitor: disk space, live memory, noise meter, GPS altimeter, barometer, altimeter\n- Hardware Check: screen dead-pixel detection\n- Photo Manager: GIF and Live Photo maker, EXIF viewer, edit or remove photo GPS location, show your chosen photos on the Home Screen, photo compression to save storage\n- Bluetooth Finder: find nearby Bluetooth devices, such as missing wireless earbuds\n- Privacy & Security Vault: private photos, videos, recordings, contacts, notes, files, and passwords; change the app icon; emergency switch to another app\n- Home Screen Widgets: hardware Dashboard (device status and network info), 50+ analog clocks and 50+ digital clocks, flip clock, dynamically updating custom photos, disk space, multifunctional launch center\n- Lock Screen Widgets: disk space and network info\n- Charging Manager: 100+ beautiful charging screens and custom backgrounds, plus a fully-charged reminder\n- Apple Watch: iPhone battery level, network traffic usage, and three built-in casual games\n- NFC Reader/Writer: scan NFC tags to read stored data; create or edit data and write it to NFC tags\n- QR & Barcode Scanner: with a scan-history manager\n- Countdown: track important dates and see how many days remain\n- Quick simple alarm\n- iPhone multifunctional flashlight (with SOS), iPad night light\n- Touch magnifier\n- Battery-saving tips for iPhone and iPad\n- Anti-collapse input helper for WeChat Moments and similar social posts\n\n* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *\nIf you enjoy Pocket Tools, please leave a 5-star rating. Your 5-star reviews keep us motivated to update and improve the app. Thank you for your support!\n\n◆ Premium Membership Subscription ◆\n• Subscribe to unlock all the features of Pocket Tools.\n• Subscriptions are billed weekly, monthly, or annually, depending on the plan you choose.\n\nBy using Pocket Tools, you agree to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use:\nhttp://www.elinapp.com/privacy_policy.html\nhttp://www.elinapp.com/terms_mobile_doctor.html\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
